{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"p0_0","type":"text","text":"# P01 · No size at all\nThe picture takes its own width, capped by the card.\n\n![[Assets/site-1.svg]]\n","x":80,"y":80,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p0_1","type":"text","text":"# P02 · One number\n`|300` is 300 wide with the shape kept.\n\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|300]]\n","x":1600,"y":80,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p0_2","type":"text","text":"# P03 · Two numbers\n`|420x160` is that box exactly, filled and cropped — never stretched.\n\n![[Assets/site-2.svg|420x160]]\n","x":3120,"y":80,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p0_3","type":"text","text":"# P04 · A row\nThree on one line is a row. The gap is the theme's, not a margin.\n\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|200]] ![[Assets/site-2.svg|200]] ![[Assets/site-3.svg|200]]\n","x":4640,"y":80,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p0_4","type":"text","text":"# P05 · Mixed sizes in a row\nDifferent numbers on one line: each keeps its own, and the row lines them up\non their middles.\n\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|260]] ![[Assets/site-2.svg|150]] ![[Assets/site-3.svg|200]]\n","x":6160,"y":80,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g0","type":"group","label":"A · Size","x":0,"y":0,"width":7520,"height":1020},
		{"id":"p1_0","type":"text","text":"#left\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|420]]\n---\n### P06 · `#left`\nThe pane decides the size, not the number in the card — `|420` is written on that embed and the picture should still fill the pane.\n","x":80,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_1","type":"text","text":"#right\n### P07 · `#right`\nThe mirror. Words left, picture right, full bleed.\n---\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|420]]\n","x":1600,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_2","type":"text","text":"#full\n![[Assets/site-2.svg]]\n","x":3120,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_3","type":"text","text":"#full\n# P09 · `#full` with a heading\nThe heading takes its line; the picture takes everything left.\n![[Assets/site-3.svg]]\n","x":4640,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_4","type":"text","text":"#gallery\n# P10 · `#gallery`\n![[Assets/site-1.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-2.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-3.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-4.svg]]\n","x":6160,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_5","type":"text","text":"#scroll\n# P11 · `#scroll`\n![[Assets/site-1.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-2.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-3.svg]]\n","x":7680,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p1_6","type":"text","text":"#slideshow\n# P12 · `#slideshow`\nArrows and dots below, or swipe. Three frames.\n![[Assets/site-1.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-2.svg]]\n![[Assets/site-3.svg]]\n","x":9200,"y":1340,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","label":"B · The picture roles","x":0,"y":1260,"width":10560,"height":1020},
		{"id":"p2_0","type":"text","text":"# P13 · Pinned to a corner\nA mark in the corner, out of the flow.\n\n:::pin bottom-right\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|140]]\n:::\n","x":80,"y":2600,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p2_1","type":"text","text":"# P14 · A pinned row\nTwo across, bottom left.\n\n:::pin bottom-left row\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|120]] ![[Assets/site-2.svg|120]]\n:::\n","x":1600,"y":2600,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p2_2","type":"text","text":"#two\n# P15 · A picture inside a column\n---\n### Left\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|260]]\nA caption under it.\n---\n### Right\n:::align centre\n![[Assets/site-2.svg|200]]\n:::\n","x":3120,"y":2600,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","label":"C · Placed","x":0,"y":2520,"width":4480,"height":1020},
		{"id":"p3_0","type":"text","text":"#left #focus-left\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|420]]\n---\n### P22 · `#focus-left`\nThe picture fills the pane and is cropped. This card keeps its **left** edge, so the label drawn at the bottom left stays whole.\n","x":80,"y":3860,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p3_1","type":"text","text":"#left #focus-right\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|420]]\n---\n### P23 · `#focus-right`\nThe same picture, the same pane, keeping the **right** edge instead. The label should now be the part that goes.\n","x":1600,"y":3860,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p3_2","type":"text","text":"#left\n![[Assets/site-4.svg|420]]\n---\n### P24 · No focus tag\nCentred, which is what happens when nothing is said: both sides lose the same amount.\n","x":3120,"y":3860,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","label":"C2 · Which part is kept","x":0,"y":3780,"width":4480,"height":1020},
		{"id":"p4_0","type":"text","text":"# P16 · A picture and a caption\nThe text under a picture is ordinary text; nothing special is needed.\n\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|320]]\n*Tower 1, level 01 — the model as issued.*\n","x":80,"y":5120,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p4_1","type":"text","text":"# P17 · Words, picture, words\nA picture is a block: it breaks the text around it rather than sitting inside\na line.\n\nBefore the picture.\n\n![[Assets/site-3.svg|280]]\n\nAfter the picture.\n","x":1600,"y":5120,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p4_2","type":"text","text":"#band\n# P18 · Icons beside lines\nA small picture on the same line as text reads as an icon.\n---\n![[Assets/site-1.svg|48]] **Tower 1** — issued\n---\n![[Assets/site-2.svg|48]] **Tower 2** — in progress\n---\n![[Assets/site-3.svg|48]] **Podium** — on hold\n","x":3120,"y":5120,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g4","type":"group","label":"D · With words","x":0,"y":5040,"width":4480,"height":1020},
		{"id":"p5_0","type":"text","text":"# P19 · A drawing\nAn SVG is a picture like any other, and stays sharp at any size.\n\n![[Assets/motion.svg|420]]\n","x":80,"y":6380,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p5_1","type":"text","text":"# P20 · Sound\nAn audio file becomes a player sized for the card.\n\n![[Assets/tone.wav]]\n","x":1600,"y":6380,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"p5_2","type":"text","text":"#two\n# P21 · A picture against a drawing\n---\n### Photograph\n![[Assets/site-2.svg|300]]\n---\n### Drawing\n![[Assets/motion.svg|300]]\n","x":3120,"y":6380,"width":1280,"height":860},
		{"id":"g5","type":"group","label":"E · Other media","x":0,"y":6300,"width":4480,"height":1020},
		{"id":"deck","type":"text","text":"#deck\n\ntheme: Atlas/Themes/Paper.css\nheader: {deck}  ·  {section}\n\n# Pictures and media\n**Every way a picture can be put on a card, in one place**\n\nAdd to this canvas rather than starting another: a new case belongs in the\nsection it tests, numbered after the last one.\n","x":0,"y":-1100,"width":7520,"height":860}
	],
